---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import PageSpread from "@/components/PageSpread.astro";
---

<Base title="About | Morax">
    <PageSpread>
        <h1>
            Hi, I'm <em>Morax</em> :3
        </h1>
        <p>
            I'm a 22-year-old cybersecurity student from Iraq, where I was born
            and still live.
        </p>
        <p>
            I build things for the web with JavaScript, TypeScript, and Go.
            Lately I've been dabbling in C and systems programming. Turns out
            programming <strong>is</strong> fun; maybe I'd just been looking at
            the boring side of it.
        </p>
        <p>
            I hope you like the theme switchers. It took me ages to get them
            looking the way I wanted. Anyway, enjoy your visit :3
        </p>

        <aside slot="side" class="about-reading onload-animation">
            <h2>On the blog</h2>
            <p>
                I’m aiming for about 80% tech and 20% whatever. For now, here
                are two movies I wrote about:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <a href="/post/hackers-1995">Hackers (1995)</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/post/chainsaw-man-reze-arc">
                        Chainsaw Man: Reze Arc
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>
    </PageSpread>
    <style is:inline>
        .about-reading ul {
            padding: 0;
            margin: 1rem 0 0;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .about-reading li {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-background-color);
        }
        .about-reading a {
            display: block;
            padding-block: 0.75rem;
            color: inherit;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
            text-decoration-color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        .about-reading a:hover {
            text-decoration-color: currentColor;
        }
    </style>
</Base>
